# You need to create a .env file in this folder and to add your API key inside it.
# In the scripts the variable is called GEMINI_API_KEY, because I used a Gemini API key.
# If you change the name of the variable here, you need to change it in the scripts too.
# Do not forget that the .env file has to stay in the .gitignore, so the key never goes
# into the repository.
GEMINI_API_KEY=...